WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.380 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.030 --> 01:37.670
[Episode 22]

4
01:38.350 --> 01:41.640
You went to the Guangchang frontline to command the battle in person,

5
01:41.640 --> 01:42.710
and we the Troika

6
01:43.280 --> 01:45.200
designed the strategic shift plan.

7
01:45.200 --> 01:48.039
Have any of us gone to the frontline

8
01:48.310 --> 01:51.759
and conduct serious investigations and research with the Corps cadres?

9
01:51.759 --> 01:52.789
In 18 days,

10
01:53.759 --> 01:56.560
there were 5,093 casualties.

11
01:59.590 --> 02:00.760
Today,

12
02:01.580 --> 02:02.630
Luofu came to me

13
02:03.430 --> 02:06.170
and told me that he was enlightened

14
02:06.200 --> 02:08.880
after reading Comrade Zedong's "Investigation Work"

15
02:08.880 --> 02:10.400
written in 1930.

16
02:11.710 --> 02:13.370
There are two sentences in it.

17
02:13.550 --> 02:15.780
One is that we need books,

18
02:16.710 --> 02:18.079
but we must correct

19
02:18.320 --> 02:20.520
the book worship that ignores reality.

20
02:21.260 --> 02:22.730
There is another sentence.

21
02:22.730 --> 02:24.800
The victory of China's revolutionary struggle

22
02:24.800 --> 02:28.260
requires Chinese comrades to understand China's situation.

23
02:28.690 --> 02:31.090
Comrade Zedong has hit the nail on the head.

24
02:31.890 --> 02:33.800
Our greatest difficulty now

25
02:34.600 --> 02:37.400
is the military struggle against the Kuomintang.

26
02:38.010 --> 02:39.870
Our opponent is Chiang Kai-shek.

27
02:40.040 --> 02:41.040
As for Chiang,

28
02:41.730 --> 02:42.850
I know him well.

29
02:43.640 --> 02:46.640
He understands military affairs and is very political savvy.

30
02:46.640 --> 02:48.240
Among those local warlords,

31
02:48.410 --> 02:50.290
there is no lack of ambitious figures.

32
02:50.290 --> 02:52.130
And each of them has their own ulterior motives,

33
02:52.130 --> 02:53.930
but they all have to respect him.

34
02:54.170 --> 02:55.480
If we talk about who in our army and our party

35
02:55.480 --> 02:57.320
can outmaneuver Chiang Kai-shek,

36
02:57.320 --> 02:59.790
except Comrade Zedong, who understands the country's situation best,

37
02:59.790 --> 03:01.250
there is no second choice.

38
03:02.850 --> 03:03.360
The Central Soviet Area's victory

39
03:03.360 --> 03:05.360
in the previous three Counter-Encirclement Campaigns

40
03:05.360 --> 03:06.320
is clear proof.

41
03:06.930 --> 03:08.730
Though the fourth Counter-Encirclement Campaign

42
03:08.730 --> 03:11.460
was commanded by Commander-in-Chief Zhu and me,

43
03:11.800 --> 03:15.000
the methods we used were still Comrade Zedong's methods.

44
03:16.760 --> 03:18.079
Let's not talk about the past.

45
03:18.079 --> 03:19.740
Let's talk about the present.

46
03:19.970 --> 03:22.320
Since we took Comrade Zedong's advice

47
03:22.450 --> 03:23.920
and changed our route at Tongdao,

48
03:23.920 --> 03:25.010
hasn't our Red Army on the western expedition

49
03:25.010 --> 03:26.870
gained more and more initiative?

50
03:27.200 --> 03:29.100
Next, how are we going to break

51
03:29.130 --> 03:31.200
the encirclement and pursuit of our enemy's hundreds of thousands of troops

52
03:31.200 --> 03:33.730
and lead the CPC Central Committee and the Red Army out of the desperate situation?

53
03:33.730 --> 03:36.190
Do you think relying on people like you and me

54
03:36.290 --> 03:37.320
can make it work?

55
03:38.010 --> 03:38.800
Bo Gu.

56
03:41.320 --> 03:42.480
We choose a leader

57
03:44.010 --> 03:46.010
for the sake of victory.

58
03:55.600 --> 03:56.600
Comrade Enlai,

59
03:57.690 --> 03:58.800
frankly speaking,

60
03:59.970 --> 04:01.170
I basically agree

61
04:02.600 --> 04:04.130
with what you said just now.

62
04:04.800 --> 04:05.850
I just feel that

63
04:06.450 --> 04:08.110
the comrades' criticism of me

64
04:08.170 --> 04:09.500
at the Zunyi Conference

65
04:11.900 --> 04:13.530
was too absolute.

66
04:27.520 --> 04:28.760
I can understand.

67
04:29.320 --> 04:30.720
At the Zunyi Conference,

68
04:30.960 --> 04:33.320
your report did not actively reflect on

69
04:33.320 --> 04:34.920
your own military mistakes.

70
04:35.640 --> 04:38.130
The comrades couldn't accept it emotionally,

71
04:38.130 --> 04:40.520
thinking that you were shirking your responsibilities.

72
04:40.520 --> 04:43.450
So inevitably, their criticism of you was too harsh.

73
04:43.570 --> 04:44.400
But,

74
04:44.840 --> 04:48.010
the comrades did not completely negate your contributions,

75
04:48.010 --> 04:50.670
nor did they completely negate your strengths.

76
04:51.130 --> 04:52.640
At the conference, Comrade Zedong

77
04:52.640 --> 04:55.840
fully acknowledged your past contributions to the Party

78
04:56.080 --> 04:59.280
and objectively analyzed the reasons for your mistakes.

79
05:13.160 --> 05:15.570
I've said so much to you today,

80
05:17.050 --> 05:19.200
which also speaks for everyone's heartfelt feelings.

81
05:19.200 --> 05:20.610
We all sincerely hope

82
05:21.450 --> 05:23.780
that you can shed your ideological burden

83
05:24.080 --> 05:25.250
and cheer up.

84
05:28.930 --> 05:30.080
Comrade Enlai.

85
05:31.690 --> 05:34.150
All the heartfelt words you said to me today,

86
05:35.280 --> 05:36.540
I've taken them all in.

87
05:37.370 --> 05:38.490
I understand.

88
05:39.610 --> 05:40.840
I agree with you.

89
05:41.720 --> 05:44.180
The CPC Central Committee can rest assured.

90
05:44.400 --> 05:46.400
I will never be a demoralized person.

91
05:46.400 --> 05:48.600
Whatever the Party asks me, Bo Gu, to do,

92
05:48.760 --> 05:49.860
I will do it.

93
05:59.840 --> 06:02.610
Around February 5, 1935,

94
06:03.050 --> 06:05.840
the CPC Central Committee held a Politburo meeting

95
06:05.840 --> 06:10.100
in Jimingsansheng Village at the junction of Sichuan, Yunnan, and Guizhou.

96
06:10.990 --> 06:12.110
Comrades.

97
06:12.450 --> 06:14.910
First, let me report on our work to everyone.

98
06:15.260 --> 06:16.870
The first draft of

99
06:17.370 --> 06:19.410
the "Resolution of the CPC Central Committee

100
06:19.410 --> 06:21.640
summing up the campaign against the enemy's fifth 'encirclement,'"

101
06:21.640 --> 06:23.930
which I was responsible for drafting, is basically complete.

102
06:23.930 --> 06:24.720
Now,

103
06:24.810 --> 06:27.810
it is formally submitted to the Politburo for review.

104
06:28.450 --> 06:29.320
Comrade Luofu.

105
06:29.690 --> 06:30.690
Lately,

106
06:30.810 --> 06:32.810
we've been either marching or fighting.

107
06:32.810 --> 06:34.870
Yet you still managed to finish the first draft of the resolution so quickly.

108
06:34.870 --> 06:36.070
That's no small feat.

109
06:36.520 --> 06:37.800
At the Zunyi Conference,

110
06:37.800 --> 06:40.230
Everyone's remarks and discussion were thorough enough,

111
06:40.230 --> 06:41.230
so it was relatively easy

112
06:41.230 --> 06:42.380
for me to compile it.

113
06:42.840 --> 06:44.200
We will relay the resolution

114
06:44.200 --> 06:46.690
to all front armies and corps.

115
06:46.750 --> 06:48.750
Only then will the Zunyi Conference

116
06:48.780 --> 06:50.780
have completed all its procedures.

117
06:51.840 --> 06:52.720
I suggest

118
06:53.250 --> 06:55.960
that after the military crisis eases,

119
06:57.810 --> 07:00.280
we should get in touch with the Communist International.

120
07:00.280 --> 07:01.050
We will then

121
07:01.370 --> 07:03.970
report the resolution of the Zunyi Conference

122
07:04.370 --> 07:06.230
to the Communist International.

123
07:06.450 --> 07:06.910
I agree.

124
07:07.010 --> 07:08.080
I agree. I agree.

125
07:08.370 --> 07:09.520
I agree. I agree.

126
07:09.760 --> 07:10.960
Good, comrades,

127
07:11.170 --> 07:13.320
let's move on to the next item on the agenda.

128
07:13.320 --> 07:14.450
On the agenda item

129
07:14.640 --> 07:17.720
regarding Comrade Bo Gu no longer serving as Head of the CPC Central Committee,

130
07:17.720 --> 07:18.840
let's vote now.

131
07:19.200 --> 07:21.460
Those in favor, please raise your hands.

132
07:31.720 --> 07:32.450
Alright.

133
07:32.520 --> 07:34.650
Comrades, please put your hands down.

134
07:34.690 --> 07:35.690
I hereby announce

135
07:35.880 --> 07:37.590
that the agenda item regarding Comrade Bo Gu no longer

136
07:37.590 --> 07:40.650
serving as Head of the CPC Central Committee is passed.

137
07:41.750 --> 07:43.610
Moving on to the next agenda item.

138
07:44.280 --> 07:47.159
Select a comrade from the Central Standing Committee

139
07:47.159 --> 07:49.640
to serve as Head of the CPC Central Committee.

140
07:49.640 --> 07:51.840
If anyone has a proposal, please speak.

141
07:55.890 --> 07:56.720
I propose

142
07:57.130 --> 07:59.450
that Comrade Mao Zedong

143
07:59.810 --> 08:02.210
serve as Head of the CPC Central Committee.

144
08:02.370 --> 08:03.490
Does everyone agree?

145
08:03.490 --> 08:03.950
I agree.

146
08:03.960 --> 08:05.730
I agree. I agree.

147
08:06.990 --> 08:08.890
Comrade Enlai, there seem to be no objections.

148
08:08.890 --> 08:10.930
I think we should approve it by voting.

149
08:10.930 --> 08:12.720
Alright. Regarding Comrade Mao Zedong…

150
08:12.720 --> 08:15.230
I don't think I'm the right fit.

151
08:23.460 --> 08:26.100
I'd rather stay as I am now,

152
08:26.720 --> 08:28.040
doing what I'm best at.

153
08:29.180 --> 08:33.440
According to the division of labor among the Standing Committee members determined at the Zunyi Conference,

154
08:33.440 --> 08:34.870
I will be Comrade Enlai's

155
08:35.460 --> 08:37.190
assistant in military command,

156
08:37.190 --> 08:39.419
assisting Enlai and the Commander-in-Chief

157
08:39.419 --> 08:41.020
in commanding combat operations against the enemy.

158
08:41.020 --> 08:42.520
This is also the top priority

159
08:42.520 --> 08:44.720
for our Party and our Red Army.

160
08:46.840 --> 08:48.090
Everyone proposed you,

161
08:48.090 --> 08:51.970
[Kai Feng (He Kequan), Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

162
08:48.210 --> 08:49.410
but you won't take it.

163
08:49.760 --> 08:53.360
Then who do you think should be Head of the CPC Central Committee?

164
08:57.640 --> 08:58.570
I propose

165
08:59.240 --> 09:02.700
that Comrade Luofu serve as Head of the CPC Central Committee.

166
09:06.210 --> 09:07.140
Comrade Zedong,

167
09:07.600 --> 09:09.520
how can you propose me?

168
09:09.880 --> 09:11.450
Why not?

169
09:12.240 --> 09:13.210
Comrade Luofu

170
09:14.050 --> 09:17.760
always upholds the Party's principles in the face of major events,

171
09:17.760 --> 09:20.520
and he always has his own thoughts and insights.

172
09:20.570 --> 09:22.120
This alone is very rare.

173
09:23.120 --> 09:24.450
Moreover, Comrade Luofu,

174
09:24.450 --> 09:26.570
you returned from studying abroad in the Soviet Union.

175
09:26.570 --> 09:28.640
When it comes to Marxist-Leninist theory,

176
09:28.640 --> 09:30.210
you are among the most outstanding in the Party.

177
09:30.210 --> 09:31.870
Are you not qualified enough?

178
09:32.690 --> 09:33.410
Also,

179
09:33.600 --> 09:36.200
if Comrade Luofu serves as the Party's leader,

180
09:36.220 --> 09:39.500
the Comintern would also find it very appropriate.

181
09:40.030 --> 09:42.880
Good talents should be put to good use, and the capable should take the position.

182
09:42.880 --> 09:44.620
I believe Comrade Luofu

183
09:44.640 --> 09:46.380
is certainly qualified for the position

184
09:46.380 --> 09:48.440
of Head of the CPC Central Committee.

185
09:50.990 --> 09:54.630
Enlai, I think we can vote now.

186
09:59.050 --> 10:02.090
Comrade Zedong puts the overall situation first,

187
10:02.690 --> 10:05.720
unites the comrades, and has a democratic way of working.

188
10:05.720 --> 10:06.870
That's truly commendable.

189
10:06.870 --> 10:07.630
Alright.

190
10:08.490 --> 10:10.660
Then let's vote by a show of hands

191
10:10.760 --> 10:13.290
on the proposal that Comrade Luofu

192
10:14.120 --> 10:16.520
serve as Head of the CPC Central Committee.

193
10:20.840 --> 10:22.370
Alright, I hereby announce

194
10:22.700 --> 10:24.730
that this proposal is passed.

195
10:36.570 --> 10:38.520
Thank you for your trust, comrades.

196
10:38.520 --> 10:39.930
Then I'll serve as Head of the CPC Central Committee

197
10:39.930 --> 10:41.000
for the time being.

198
10:41.690 --> 10:43.480
Once the situation stabilizes,

199
10:43.480 --> 10:44.540
everyone can elect

200
10:44.600 --> 10:47.660
a more suitable comrade to take on this important post.

201
10:52.470 --> 10:53.390
Hong, come in.

202
11:18.450 --> 11:20.520
These are all the documents and seals of the CPC Central Committee.

203
11:20.520 --> 11:22.050
I packed them up last night.

204
11:24.850 --> 11:25.970
Comrade Luofu,

205
11:27.450 --> 11:29.240
the burden of leading the CPC Central Committee

206
11:29.240 --> 11:30.450
is now handed over to you.

207
11:30.450 --> 11:31.250
Comrade Bo Gu,

208
11:31.410 --> 11:33.840
there's no rush for the handover right this moment.

209
11:33.840 --> 11:35.440
The situation is urgent now.

210
11:35.640 --> 11:38.270
The Central Committee's decisions cannot be delayed.

211
11:38.270 --> 11:40.520
I'll also feel more at ease once I hand them over to you.

212
11:40.520 --> 11:42.330
Please come and check them.

213
11:49.210 --> 11:49.910
Okay.

214
11:54.990 --> 11:55.540
Here.

215
11:56.930 --> 11:57.970
Comrade Bo Gu.

216
11:58.480 --> 12:00.330
Though you've handed over the role

217
12:00.330 --> 12:02.410
of Head of the CPC Central Committee to Luofu,

218
12:02.410 --> 12:04.010
the weight on your shoulders

219
12:04.330 --> 12:05.450
has not lessened.

220
12:05.930 --> 12:07.760
All of us still need to

221
12:08.240 --> 12:09.970
shoulder the various future tasks

222
12:09.970 --> 12:11.970
of the Central Committee together.

223
12:13.740 --> 12:14.350
Yes.

224
12:14.760 --> 12:16.970
We all share the same pot

225
12:17.640 --> 12:19.210
and rally under the same banner.

226
12:19.210 --> 12:20.070
Only in this way

227
12:20.450 --> 12:23.050
can our banner stand firm

228
12:23.600 --> 12:25.050
and flutter forever.

229
12:28.720 --> 12:29.720
Comrade Luofu.

230
12:32.170 --> 12:33.500
Thanks in advance for your hard work.

231
12:33.500 --> 12:34.360
I'll do my best.

232
12:35.940 --> 12:37.290
Report, leaders.

233
12:37.540 --> 12:38.320
We received

234
12:38.590 --> 12:42.250
an urgent telegram from Comrade Xiang Ying of the Central Bureau.

235
12:45.330 --> 12:46.380
Comrade Luofu.

236
12:49.630 --> 12:50.830
How's the situation?

237
12:51.460 --> 12:52.920
It's extremely critical.

238
12:53.290 --> 12:55.200
They've been besieged by the KMT troops

239
12:55.200 --> 12:56.800
in a narrow area around Yudu.

240
12:57.210 --> 12:58.230
They've suffered heavy casualties

241
12:58.230 --> 12:59.780
and can hardly hold on.

242
13:02.520 --> 13:04.640
Why didn't they break out of the encirclement as soon as possible?

243
13:04.640 --> 13:06.840
Judging from Comrade Xiang Ying's wording,

244
13:06.840 --> 13:09.210
this is not the first time he has sent a telegram to the Central Committee.

245
13:09.210 --> 13:10.970
Rather, he has sent multiple telegrams,

246
13:10.970 --> 13:13.410
asking for instructions on the next course of action.

247
13:13.410 --> 13:14.760
Why even ask for instructions?

248
13:14.760 --> 13:15.810
They need to be flexible

249
13:15.810 --> 13:16.870
and survive first.

250
13:16.970 --> 13:18.810
Given the working style of Comrade Xiang Ying,

251
13:18.810 --> 13:20.800
without clear instructions from the Central Committee,

252
13:20.800 --> 13:23.010
it's hard for him to be flexible.

253
13:26.540 --> 13:29.160
He doesn't know yet that we've held the Zunyi Conference

254
13:29.160 --> 13:32.040
and that our working methods are going to change.

255
13:34.180 --> 13:35.140
I think

256
13:36.010 --> 13:38.520
we should immediately reply to the Central Bureau,

257
13:38.520 --> 13:41.410
telling them to disperse and break out

258
13:41.720 --> 13:43.520
of the enemy's encirclement as soon as possible,

259
13:43.520 --> 13:46.000
change their ways of organizing and fighting,

260
13:46.000 --> 13:48.530
and extensively carry out guerrilla warfare

261
13:48.600 --> 13:51.800
in the Central Soviet Area and neighboring Soviet areas.

262
13:52.520 --> 13:53.410
Comrade Luofu,

263
13:53.880 --> 13:55.080
what's your opinion?

264
13:55.510 --> 13:56.230
I agree.

265
13:56.500 --> 13:57.330
Comrade Zedong,

266
13:57.330 --> 13:59.090
you draft the telegram.

267
14:01.640 --> 14:02.220
Okay.

268
14:03.620 --> 14:09.620
[Jingtang Village, Yudu, Jiangxi] [Encampment of the Central Bureau]

269
14:24.210 --> 14:25.340
Comrade Xiang Ying!

270
14:26.930 --> 14:27.650
Xiang Ying.

271
14:31.570 --> 14:33.800
Here's a telegram from the Central Committee.

272
14:33.800 --> 14:35.460
Am I delirious from the fever?

273
14:37.560 --> 14:38.290
Does it hurt?

274
14:38.520 --> 14:38.920
Yes.

275
14:39.050 --> 14:39.880
Can you get up?

276
14:40.170 --> 14:40.760
Yes.

277
14:41.480 --> 14:42.240
Come on.

278
14:45.530 --> 14:46.490
Look.

279
14:48.690 --> 14:49.570
Finally.

280
14:49.970 --> 14:51.840
We've finally received instructions from the Central Committee.

281
14:51.840 --> 14:52.900
Read it carefully.

282
14:53.410 --> 14:54.540
The Central Committee wants us

283
14:54.540 --> 14:57.240
to change our forms of struggle and organization,

284
14:57.240 --> 14:58.040
break out of the encirclement immediately,

285
14:58.040 --> 15:00.170
disperse the troops, and carry out guerrilla warfare.

286
15:00.170 --> 15:00.840
Okay.

287
15:01.600 --> 15:04.400
[Xiang Ying, Member of CPC Central Secretariat, Secretary of the CPC Central Bureau in the Soviet Area]

288
15:01.970 --> 15:04.290
I'll gather everyone for a meeting immediately

289
15:04.290 --> 15:06.240
and act according to the Central Committee's instructions.

290
15:06.240 --> 15:07.370
Comrade Xiang Ying,

291
15:07.480 --> 15:08.290
I wonder

292
15:09.640 --> 15:10.970
if you smelled anything

293
15:11.920 --> 15:13.240
in this telegram.

294
15:13.880 --> 15:14.940
Smelled anything?

295
15:15.690 --> 15:16.640
What?

296
15:17.740 --> 15:18.990
The smell of chili.

297
15:23.610 --> 15:25.270
You're actually smelling it?

298
15:26.090 --> 15:27.690
The wording of this telegram

299
15:27.810 --> 15:29.670
is clearly Chairman Mao's style.

300
15:29.880 --> 15:32.480
Bo Gu and Li De couldn't write like this,

301
15:32.640 --> 15:34.840
nor could they give such instructions.

302
15:35.480 --> 15:36.610
What does this mean?

303
15:38.170 --> 15:39.090
I feel that

304
15:39.600 --> 15:42.600
Chairman Mao is coming back to lead the Red Army again.

305
15:43.930 --> 15:44.530
Back then,

306
15:45.520 --> 15:47.380
I always opposed Comrade Zedong.

307
15:50.810 --> 15:52.470
Let's have the meeting first.

308
15:53.400 --> 15:54.000
By the way,

309
15:54.120 --> 15:55.570
I gave you a plan

310
15:55.720 --> 15:57.330
for guerrilla warfare before.

311
15:57.330 --> 15:58.410
Do you still have it?

312
15:58.410 --> 15:59.600
Take it. It will be useful.

313
15:59.600 --> 16:00.130
I have it.

314
16:07.190 --> 16:09.870
Issue it in the name of the Central Bureau.

315
16:13.570 --> 16:16.000
In early February 1935,

316
16:16.790 --> 16:20.000
according to the Central Committee's instructions, the CPC Central Bureau in the Soviet Area

317
16:18.780 --> 16:20.990
[Qu Qiubai, Minister of the Publicity Department of the CPC Central Bureau in the Soviet Area]

318
16:20.350 --> 16:22.420
established the Central Soviet Area Branch

319
16:22.420 --> 16:25.200
of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

320
16:25.200 --> 16:27.230
chaired by Xiang Ying and composed of five members

321
16:27.230 --> 16:28.960
including Chen Yi and He Chang,

322
16:29.000 --> 16:31.400
and began to formulate a breakout plan.

323
16:38.880 --> 16:39.810
Comrades.

324
16:40.620 --> 16:42.880
The CPC Central Committee is still here.

325
16:43.860 --> 16:46.720
The main force of the Central Red Army is still here.

326
16:47.930 --> 16:49.600
They are fighting against the enemy

327
16:49.600 --> 16:51.290
in the border region of Sichuan, Yunnan, and Guizhou.

328
16:51.290 --> 16:52.290
This is

329
16:52.930 --> 16:54.460
a huge encouragement to us.

330
16:55.090 --> 16:56.550
It is also the very meaning

331
16:56.570 --> 16:58.330
of us staying behind.

332
16:59.240 --> 17:01.690
According to the Central Committee's instructions,

333
17:01.690 --> 17:04.440
we're going to leave the Central Soviet Area soon.

334
17:04.440 --> 17:05.800
But we must not be discouraged

335
17:05.800 --> 17:09.310
[He Shuheng, Member of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

336
17:06.720 --> 17:07.720
or lose heart.

337
17:08.410 --> 17:09.740
We must strictly follow

338
17:09.760 --> 17:11.819
the breakout plan we just formulated

339
17:12.030 --> 17:14.849
and strive to preserve our strength as much as possible

340
17:14.849 --> 17:16.930
to face even harder struggles.

341
17:21.210 --> 17:22.869
Are you okay, Comrade Qiubai?

342
17:25.950 --> 17:26.910
Comrades.

343
17:28.550 --> 17:29.680
I have a suggestion.

344
17:32.560 --> 17:35.160
Though we're leaving the Central Soviet Area,

345
17:36.110 --> 17:38.370
we can't leave with a pessimistic heart.

346
17:39.170 --> 17:40.630
We must leave hope behind.

347
17:41.590 --> 17:43.720
The Lantern Festival is approaching.

348
17:43.760 --> 17:44.930
Before we leave,

349
17:45.610 --> 17:49.560
I want to gather all the remaining members

350
17:50.010 --> 17:52.560
of the three theater troupes, Red Flag, Battle Horn, and Spark,

351
17:52.560 --> 17:54.560
build a stage in Jingtang Village,

352
17:55.030 --> 17:57.360
and hold one more grand arts performance.

353
17:57.480 --> 17:59.760
It will be a farewell to the people of the Soviet Area.

354
17:59.760 --> 18:01.240
It's also a way to tell everyone

355
18:01.240 --> 18:02.610
that we will come back.

356
18:04.560 --> 18:06.220
We will definitely come back.

357
18:07.490 --> 18:08.400
Good.

358
18:11.720 --> 18:12.760
We will definitely come back.

359
18:12.760 --> 18:13.850
We will definitely come back.

360
18:13.850 --> 18:15.310
We will fight our way back.

361
18:15.450 --> 18:20.870
[Jingtang Village, Yudu, Jiangxi]

362
18:21.480 --> 18:24.890
♪ Chives bloom with a single heart ♪

363
18:24.890 --> 18:28.610
♪ Cut off my hair and join the Red Army ♪

364
18:28.610 --> 18:30.890
♪ Wearing a five-pointed star cap on my head ♪

365
18:30.890 --> 18:33.930
♪ With a spear on my shoulder, I look so energetic ♪

366
18:33.960 --> 18:35.640
How do we look?

367
18:37.300 --> 18:38.210
Very nice.

368
18:39.210 --> 18:40.120
Energetic.

369
18:41.060 --> 18:42.060
Comrade Qiubai.

370
18:43.370 --> 18:45.500
Are we really leaving the Soviet Area?

371
18:45.900 --> 18:46.860
Comrade Qiubai,

372
18:46.890 --> 18:47.850
once we leave,

373
18:48.210 --> 18:50.010
are we really never coming back?

374
18:54.460 --> 18:55.380
Comrades.

375
18:58.210 --> 18:59.520
You must not cry today.

376
19:00.000 --> 19:01.240
Hold back your tears.

377
19:01.450 --> 19:02.560
You must smile.

378
19:02.690 --> 19:04.520
Leave your most beautiful smiles

379
19:04.520 --> 19:06.250
to the folks of the Soviet Area.

380
19:06.610 --> 19:07.370
Understand?

381
19:08.110 --> 19:08.980
Yes!

382
19:10.410 --> 19:12.280
♪ I'm so happy ♪

383
19:12.650 --> 19:13.320
Salute!

384
19:13.690 --> 19:15.210
Good!

385
19:17.240 --> 19:18.110
Order arms.

386
19:19.310 --> 19:20.170
It's your turn.

387
19:20.320 --> 19:21.310
Hurry up and get ready.

388
19:21.310 --> 19:22.040
Okay.

389
19:26.650 --> 19:27.480
Next program,

390
19:27.560 --> 19:29.160
please enjoy the hula dance,

391
19:29.240 --> 19:31.970
"The Taiwanese People Resist the Colonialists,"

392
19:31.970 --> 19:34.300
performed by the Red Flag Theater Troupe.

393
19:34.320 --> 19:36.610
Good!

394
19:36.920 --> 19:37.850
Go!

395
19:38.120 --> 19:39.250
Remember to smile!

396
19:39.280 --> 19:39.800
Sure.

397
20:08.310 --> 20:10.450
[Mao Zetan, Commander of the Independent Division of Red Army]

398
21:41.210 --> 21:42.800
Good! Good!

399
21:43.480 --> 21:46.000
Good! Good!

400
21:47.130 --> 21:48.370
Salute!

401
22:38.690 --> 22:39.930
Comrades!

402
22:41.040 --> 22:42.570
Please hold your heads high

403
22:42.940 --> 22:44.400
and listen to this melody.

404
22:45.290 --> 22:47.690
This is the battle song of the proletariat.

405
22:48.170 --> 22:50.080
This is the cry of the Communists.

406
22:50.930 --> 22:52.610
We must always maintain

407
22:53.010 --> 22:55.010
the belief in striving for victory.

408
22:55.970 --> 22:57.560
Just as Mr. Lu Xun

409
22:58.040 --> 23:00.480
wrote in his article,

410
23:00.930 --> 23:03.060
we should not be ashamed of being last.

411
23:03.130 --> 23:04.370
Even if we are slow,

412
23:04.610 --> 23:06.410
we must keep moving without stopping.

413
23:06.410 --> 23:07.670
Even if we fall behind,

414
23:08.040 --> 23:09.480
even if we fail,

415
23:09.970 --> 23:11.320
we will certainly reach

416
23:11.650 --> 23:13.480
the goal we yearn for.

417
23:13.480 --> 23:15.410
Great!

418
23:15.650 --> 23:19.210
Great! Great!

419
23:26.690 --> 23:27.890
♪ Arise ♪

420
23:28.210 --> 23:31.450
♪ Ye prisoners of starvation! ♪

421
23:31.970 --> 23:32.930
♪ Arise ♪

422
23:33.240 --> 23:36.210
♪ Ye wretched of the earth! ♪

423
23:36.450 --> 23:41.170
♪ For justice thunders condemnation ♪

424
23:41.170 --> 23:45.760
♪ A better world's in birth! ♪

425
23:46.320 --> 23:50.560
♪ No more tradition's chains shall bind us ♪

426
23:51.040 --> 23:55.720
♪ Arise, ye slaves, no more in thrall! ♪

427
23:55.720 --> 24:00.170
♪ The earth shall rise on new foundations ♪

428
24:00.170 --> 24:07.760
♪ We have been nought, we shall be all! ♪

429
24:08.280 --> 24:11.210
Starting in mid-February 1935,

430
24:11.280 --> 24:12.450
over 10,000 Red Army commanders, fighters,

431
24:12.450 --> 24:14.410
and local staff,

432
24:14.410 --> 24:16.280
who had been besieged by the enemy

433
24:16.280 --> 24:18.170
in the narrow strip of the Central Soviet Area,

434
24:18.170 --> 24:20.170
were divided into nine routes and set out one after another

435
24:20.170 --> 24:21.800
to break out in different directions,

436
24:21.800 --> 24:23.800
launching mass guerrilla warfare.

437
24:23.800 --> 24:26.360
This is known in history as the Nine-Route Breakout.

438
24:26.360 --> 24:29.050
However, because the breakout was too late,

439
24:29.070 --> 24:31.760
the room for maneuver in each troop's breakout operations

440
24:31.760 --> 24:34.290
had been compressed to the limit by the enemy.

441
24:35.130 --> 24:36.280
As a result, each troop

442
24:36.280 --> 24:39.760
suffered heavy casualties during the breakout.

443
24:37.460 --> 24:40.190
[Qu Qiubai, one of the primary leaders of the CPC, a great Marxist, a distinguished proletarian revolutionary,]

444
24:40.210 --> 24:43.600
[theorist and publicist, one of the central founders of the Revolutionary Literature of China.]

445
24:40.410 --> 24:44.890
He Shuheng, Qu Qiubai, He Chang, Ruan Xiaoxian,

446
24:43.630 --> 24:45.810
[In February 1935, he was arrested by the KMT in Changting, Fujian; on June 18, at the age of 36, he met death with composure.]

447
24:45.040 --> 24:48.850
Liu Bojian, Mao Zetan, and other outstanding cadres of the Party

448
24:46.970 --> 24:51.170
[He Shuheng, a proletarian revolutionary, representative of the 1st National Congress of the CPC, one of the founders of the CPC.]

449
24:48.850 --> 24:51.190
heroically sacrificed their lives one after another.

450
24:51.190 --> 24:54.120
[On February 24, 1935, at the age of 59, he died a heroic death during the breakout battle in Changting.]

451
24:51.930 --> 24:53.850
In late April 1935,

452
24:54.030 --> 24:57.030
Xiang Ying and Chen Yi, who broke out of the encirclement in the last route,

453
24:54.920 --> 24:57.230
[Mao Zetan, a proletarian revolutionary, former member of the CPC Central Bureau in the Soviet Area]

454
24:57.170 --> 24:58.610
led their troops

455
24:57.230 --> 24:59.550
[Commander of the Independent Division of Red Army, Commander of the Fujian-Jiangxi Military Region.]

456
24:58.610 --> 25:00.930
to the Youshan area at the border of Jiangxi and Guangdong.

457
24:59.570 --> 25:03.520
[On April 26, 1935, at the age of 29, he sacrificed his life in the Honglin Mountains of Ruijin, Jiangxi, while covering the escape of guerrillas.]

458
25:00.930 --> 25:02.450
Together with the Red Army guerrilla units

459
25:02.450 --> 25:04.170
from eight southern provinces,

460
25:04.170 --> 25:06.130
they carried out the extremely arduous

461
25:06.130 --> 25:08.480
three-year guerrilla war in the south.

462
25:08.890 --> 25:10.320
After the Central Bureau

463
25:10.320 --> 25:12.000
implemented the Nine-Route Breakout,

464
25:12.000 --> 25:13.720
the Red Army troops in the surrounding areas

465
25:13.720 --> 25:15.760
also responded to the call of the Central Committee.

466
25:15.760 --> 25:17.300
They broke out of the encirclements in different routes

467
25:17.300 --> 25:18.200
but likewise suffered

468
25:18.200 --> 25:20.810
the cruel "encirclement and suppression" by the KMT troops.

469
25:20.810 --> 25:23.830
Among them, the Party, government, and military organs of Fujian Province,

470
25:23.830 --> 25:27.250
which successively withdrew to the south of Changting in western Fujian and the north of Wuping,

471
25:27.250 --> 25:28.480
along with the left-behind troops

472
25:28.480 --> 25:31.240
and local armed forces, which totaled more than 4,000 people,

473
25:31.240 --> 25:32.270
fought bloody battles

474
25:32.270 --> 25:34.000
under the suppression of about 100,000 soldiers

475
25:34.000 --> 25:35.170
of the KMT troops.

476
25:35.210 --> 25:37.090
They paid a heavy price

477
25:37.120 --> 25:39.380
and most of them sacrificed their lives.

478
25:39.850 --> 25:41.650
In April 1935,

479
25:41.690 --> 25:43.800
in the final bloody breakout battle

480
25:43.800 --> 25:45.890
in Shanghu Village, Dahe, Wuping,

481
25:46.370 --> 25:47.930
Wan Yongcheng, Secretary of the Fujian Provincial Committee of the CPC

482
25:47.930 --> 25:50.800
and Political Commissar of the Fujian Military Region,

483
25:50.800 --> 25:53.520
Long Tengyun, Commander of the Fujian Military Region,

484
25:53.520 --> 25:55.800
You Duanxuan, Chief of Staff of the Military Region,

485
25:55.800 --> 25:57.450
and other outstanding cadres of our Party

486
25:57.450 --> 26:00.450
heroically sacrificed their lives one after another during the breakout,

487
26:00.450 --> 26:04.890
fulfilling their loyalty to the Party and the people with their lives.

488
26:06.580 --> 26:08.860
On February 9, 1935,

489
26:08.900 --> 26:12.960
the Central Red Army entered and garrisoned Zhaxi Town, Weixin, Yunnan.

490
26:13.040 --> 26:13.770
At this time,

491
26:13.930 --> 26:16.760
Chiang Kai-shek ordered Liu Xiang's Sichuan Army

492
26:16.790 --> 26:18.810
to deploy heavy troops to blockade the Yangtze River,

493
26:18.810 --> 26:21.930
completely blocking the Central Red Army's plan to cross north.

494
26:21.930 --> 26:22.930
On the other hand,

495
26:23.240 --> 26:24.890
he ordered the Yunnan Army and the Central Army

496
26:24.890 --> 26:26.690
to encircle the Central Red Army

497
26:26.720 --> 26:29.650
from different routes on the western and southern fronts.

498
26:29.650 --> 26:31.690
The Central Red Army once again

499
26:31.690 --> 26:34.020
faced a critical moment of life and death.

500
26:34.280 --> 26:35.140
On the same day,

501
26:35.560 --> 26:37.240
the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee

502
26:37.240 --> 26:39.800
held an expanded meeting of the Politburo

503
26:39.800 --> 26:42.370
in Jiangxi Guild Hall on the old street of Zhaxi Town

504
26:42.370 --> 26:45.410
to discuss the next course of action of the Central Red Army.

505
26:45.160 --> 26:51.350
[Jiangxi Guild Hall, Zhaxi Town, Weixin, Yunnan]

506
26:45.580 --> 26:49.580
According to the enemy telegram just intercepted by the Second Bureau,

507
26:49.760 --> 26:51.890
Chiang Kai-shek has already adjusted his deployment.

508
26:51.890 --> 26:54.480
He gathered all forces of the Yunnan Army, Sichuan Army,

509
26:54.480 --> 26:56.890
and Central Army to encircle us.

510
26:57.450 --> 26:58.410
The overall plan

511
26:58.760 --> 27:00.930
is to annihilate our army

512
27:01.800 --> 27:02.800
in the Zhaxi area.

513
27:05.130 --> 27:06.800
The newly appointed Commander-in-Chief

514
27:06.800 --> 27:08.280
of the Second Route "Encirclement and Suppression" Army of the KMT troops,

515
27:08.280 --> 27:08.850
Long Yun,

516
27:09.450 --> 27:11.710
believes that we've entered a death trap

517
27:12.240 --> 27:14.260
and intends to fight a decisive battle with us.

518
27:14.260 --> 27:16.080
In the telegram he sent to his subordinates,

519
27:16.080 --> 27:17.410
he encouraged them by saying,

520
27:17.410 --> 27:20.410
'Seek historical glory through immense sacrifice.'

521
27:21.340 --> 27:22.300
Daydreaming.

522
27:22.640 --> 27:23.240
Bocheng.

523
27:24.380 --> 27:26.640
How fast are the enemy forces advancing?

524
27:26.650 --> 27:27.560
Very fast.

525
27:28.040 --> 27:29.850
It is estimated that they will

526
27:30.210 --> 27:33.210
form a final encirclement of our army around the 13th.

527
27:33.450 --> 27:34.680
By then, we will have to fight this battle

528
27:34.680 --> 27:36.850
whether we want to or not.

529
27:39.600 --> 27:40.560
Today is the 9th,

530
27:41.170 --> 27:43.570
which means we still have four days.

531
27:43.600 --> 27:44.710
Four days at most.

532
27:49.240 --> 27:50.890
If the enemy changes, we change.

533
27:50.890 --> 27:53.220
Then we will switch to another direction.

534
27:54.200 --> 27:54.960
Zunyi.

535
27:55.270 --> 27:55.880
Zunyi?

536
27:55.900 --> 27:56.890
Yes, Zunyi.

537
27:58.170 --> 27:59.900
Tens of thousands of KMT troops

538
28:00.000 --> 28:01.930
want to fight a decisive battle with us in Zhaxi.

539
28:01.930 --> 28:03.410
Then, right now, in the whole northern Guizhou,

540
28:03.410 --> 28:05.520
there are only Wang Jialie's dual-pipe soldiers.

541
28:05.520 --> 28:07.050
We'll turn back and strike.

542
28:07.080 --> 28:09.850
We'll turn around to cross the Chishui River again,

543
28:09.850 --> 28:10.800
retake Zunyi,

544
28:11.130 --> 28:13.190
shift our target to the Guizhou army,

545
28:13.410 --> 28:15.570
or even the First Troop of the Central Army in Guiyang,

546
28:15.570 --> 28:17.830
and fight a few battles of annihilation.

547
28:18.160 --> 28:19.690
Can the crisis be resolved?

548
28:20.710 --> 28:21.670
Brilliant move.

549
28:22.470 --> 28:24.200
An absolutely brilliant move.

550
28:25.130 --> 28:26.390
It is a brilliant move,

551
28:26.690 --> 28:30.370
but I'm afraid it means another long trek in southern Sichuan.

552
28:30.850 --> 28:32.000
Going back the way we came.

553
28:32.000 --> 28:35.800
I'm afraid the comrades won't understand and will have misgivings.

554
28:35.930 --> 28:37.330
That is indeed a problem.

555
28:39.390 --> 28:41.600
We march in order to survive.

556
28:42.240 --> 28:43.460
We must make this clear

557
28:43.460 --> 28:45.550
to all commanders and fighters.

558
28:46.280 --> 28:48.450
How about this? I will draft

559
28:48.890 --> 28:51.000
a "Letter to All Red Commanders and Fighters."

560
28:51.000 --> 28:53.520
Issue it in the name of the Central Committee and the Military Commission.

561
28:53.520 --> 28:56.610
Make sure everyone understands why we're marching this way.

562
28:56.610 --> 28:57.810
Just as Comrade Luofu

563
28:58.000 --> 29:00.450
stated in the resolution of the Zunyi Conference,

564
29:00.450 --> 29:02.110
calling on all Party comrades

565
29:02.370 --> 29:03.840
to unite around the Central Committee

566
29:03.840 --> 29:05.230
as one.

567
29:06.300 --> 29:07.230
I think it works.

568
29:07.890 --> 29:08.620
In addition,

569
29:09.000 --> 29:10.610
based on the current situation,

570
29:10.610 --> 29:11.730
the troops should conduct flexible mobile operations

571
29:11.730 --> 29:13.640
in the next step.

572
29:14.080 --> 29:17.320
I suggest downsizing the troops

573
29:17.850 --> 29:20.510
to meet the requirements of mobile operations.

574
29:20.690 --> 29:22.130
Except for the Cadre Regiment,

575
29:22.130 --> 29:24.400
they will be uniformly downsized into sixteen regiments,

576
29:24.400 --> 29:27.580
then quickly break away from the encirclement of the KMT troops,

577
29:27.580 --> 29:29.930
and advance to northern Guizhou.

578
29:30.720 --> 29:31.630
I agree.

579
29:59.480 --> 30:00.650
Brother! Brother!

580
30:00.680 --> 30:01.760
Is my brother inside?

581
30:01.760 --> 30:03.080
Chairman is writing inside.

582
30:03.080 --> 30:03.910
Come in.

583
30:06.390 --> 30:07.630
Zemin, what's wrong?

584
30:07.840 --> 30:10.170
Brother, Sister-in-law has given birth.

585
30:12.080 --> 30:13.080
It's a girl.

586
30:14.110 --> 30:15.590
She has been given to a local family.

587
30:15.520 --> 30:18.270
[Mao Zemin, Political Commissar of the 15th Regiment of the Central Column]

588
30:15.970 --> 30:16.760
Xijun said

589
30:17.060 --> 30:18.690
the family looks kind.

590
30:29.180 --> 30:30.150
How is Zizhen?

591
30:30.240 --> 30:31.900
Sister-in-law is doing fine,

592
30:31.970 --> 30:33.370
just a bit weak.

593
30:33.960 --> 30:35.220
She asked me to tell you

594
30:35.410 --> 30:36.800
that she knows you are busy,

595
30:36.800 --> 30:39.400
so focus on your work and don't worry about her.

596
30:39.470 --> 30:41.670
She will be fine after a few days of rest.

597
31:14.330 --> 31:15.790
The CPC Central Committee

598
31:16.040 --> 31:18.720
and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission's

599
31:18.720 --> 31:21.250
"Letter to All Red Commanders and Fighters."

600
31:21.590 --> 31:23.860
Dear all Red fighters,

601
31:24.750 --> 31:27.750
commanders, and political staff,

602
31:28.290 --> 31:30.890
We are now in the vast areas

603
31:30.910 --> 31:33.370
of Yunnan, Guizhou, and Sichuan provinces.

604
31:33.750 --> 31:35.510
We are going to create

605
31:35.540 --> 31:38.010
a new Soviet base area here.

606
31:38.530 --> 31:41.260
Because the Sichuan and Yunnan warlords have concentrated all their forces

607
31:41.260 --> 31:43.360
and use the natural barrier of the Yangtze River

608
31:43.360 --> 31:45.960
to set up defenses along it to block us,

609
31:46.810 --> 31:49.270
and because the Party and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

610
31:49.270 --> 31:51.140
are unwilling to sacrifice the Red Army's effective strength

611
31:51.140 --> 31:53.300
over territorial issues,

612
31:54.700 --> 31:58.460
we have decided to stop advancing towards northern Sichuan.

613
31:59.650 --> 32:01.240
Instead, we have finally decided

614
32:01.240 --> 32:02.410
to establish a base area

615
32:02.410 --> 32:05.540
in the three provinces of Yunnan, Guizhou, and Sichuan.

616
32:05.850 --> 32:08.400
In order to achieve victory with certainty,

617
32:09.720 --> 32:12.930
we must seek favorable opportunities

618
32:13.210 --> 32:15.320
and areas to eliminate the enemy.

619
32:16.280 --> 32:18.130
Under unfavorable conditions,

620
32:18.370 --> 32:21.650
we should refuse those risky battles

621
32:21.860 --> 32:24.260
without the certainty of victory.

622
32:26.130 --> 32:26.930
Therefore,

623
32:28.050 --> 32:33.720
the Red Army must frequently shift its combat areas.

624
32:34.610 --> 32:35.870
Sometimes to the east,

625
32:36.320 --> 32:37.580
sometimes to the west;

626
32:38.240 --> 32:39.760
sometimes taking main roads,

627
32:39.760 --> 32:41.490
sometimes taking small paths;

628
32:41.690 --> 32:43.320
sometimes taking old routes,

629
32:43.320 --> 32:45.180
and sometimes taking new routes.

630
32:45.350 --> 32:46.790
And the only purpose

631
32:47.560 --> 32:50.360
is to seek victory in battle

632
32:50.970 --> 32:53.240
under favorable conditions.

633
32:54.080 --> 32:56.970
In order to seek a certain victory,

634
32:57.620 --> 32:58.300
we

635
32:58.440 --> 33:01.990
must seek rest and reorganization for the troops,

636
33:03.720 --> 33:07.370
strengthen our political work a hundredfold,

637
33:08.320 --> 33:10.480
improve our combat effectiveness,

638
33:11.560 --> 33:14.180
and consolidate our determination and confidence

639
33:14.180 --> 33:16.340
in establishing a new Soviet area.

640
33:16.800 --> 33:22.020
The CPC Central Committee and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission call on all comrades

641
33:22.020 --> 33:24.060
to muster a hundredfold courage,

642
33:24.690 --> 33:26.400
heighten the determination to fight,

643
33:26.400 --> 33:28.530
and struggle to wipe out the evil enemy

644
33:30.300 --> 33:32.900
and create a new Soviet area

645
33:32.930 --> 33:34.810
in Yunnan, Guizhou, and Sichuan.

646
33:36.430 --> 33:37.560
All comrades,

647
33:38.080 --> 33:42.040
let's fight together for this bright future.

648
33:43.700 --> 33:45.420
The CPC Central Committee

649
33:45.800 --> 33:47.890
and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

650
33:47.890 --> 33:50.370
On February 15, 1935,

651
33:51.000 --> 33:53.520
the Central Column directly under the Central Committee arrived at

652
33:53.520 --> 33:55.280
Baishachang, Gulin, Sichuan.

653
33:56.050 --> 33:57.900
The CPC Central Committee and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

654
33:57.900 --> 33:59.830
held a meeting on that day,

655
34:00.340 --> 34:01.860
formulated and issued

656
34:01.880 --> 34:05.270
the "Plan for the Red Army to Cross the Chishui River Eastward."

657
34:05.270 --> 34:06.000
The next day,

658
34:06.130 --> 34:07.290
they also issued

659
34:07.320 --> 34:10.050
the "Letter to All Red Commanders and Fighters."

660
34:10.250 --> 34:11.080
This

661
34:11.250 --> 34:14.780
opened the prelude to the second crossing of the Chishui River.

662
34:29.770 --> 34:33.440
From February 18 to 21, 1935,

663
34:33.870 --> 34:35.780
the Central Red Army crossed the Chishui River eastward

664
34:35.780 --> 34:38.440
from Taipingdu, Erlangtan, and other ferries,

665
34:38.639 --> 34:41.889
and advanced rapidly in two columns toward the Tongzi area,

666
34:41.889 --> 34:43.550
where the Kuomintang forces were weakest.

667
34:43.550 --> 34:46.850
This is known in history as the Second Crossing of the Chishui River.

668
34:46.850 --> 34:47.850
Comrades,

669
34:49.460 --> 34:51.820
Chiang Kai-shek's planes at night

670
34:52.010 --> 34:53.480
are blind.

671
34:54.409 --> 34:56.080
They dare not come out.

672
34:56.850 --> 34:58.710
Everyone, light up your torches.

673
34:59.060 --> 35:00.620
Light up your torches!

674
35:00.640 --> 35:02.080
Light up your torches!

675
35:03.600 --> 35:06.290
Sing the Kuaiban!

676
35:06.520 --> 35:09.200
Propaganda troupe, sing Kuaiban!

677
35:13.370 --> 35:15.290
Crossing the Chishui River back and forth,

678
35:15.290 --> 35:17.160
the tactical maneuvers are flexible.

679
35:17.160 --> 35:19.000
The Sichuan Army is puzzled and calls it going in circles.

680
35:19.000 --> 35:20.890
The Yunnan Army is confused and calls it pushing a millstone.

681
35:20.890 --> 35:22.620
It stumps Liu Xiang and Xue Yue.

682
35:22.640 --> 35:24.560
Bald Chiang has no choice.

683
35:26.560 --> 35:28.200
Mobile warfare is really good.

684
35:28.200 --> 35:30.110
Lead the White bandits to push a big millstone.

685
35:30.110 --> 35:31.730
Sometimes slow, sometimes fast.

686
35:31.730 --> 35:33.770
Whether to fight or leave is all up to me.

687
35:33.770 --> 35:35.560
The Red Army is full of vigor and vitality,

688
35:35.560 --> 35:39.160
subduing demons on the borders of Sichuan, Guizhou, and Yunnan.

689
35:49.880 --> 35:57.010
[Guiyang, Guizhou; Xue Yue's Headquarters]

690
35:55.800 --> 36:00.200
Commander-in-Chief, here's a handwritten order from Generalissimo Chiang.

691
36:04.220 --> 36:06.010
[Xue Yue, Commander-in-chief of the 2nd Army Group of the KMT's Pursuit Army]

692
36:04.450 --> 36:05.380
What does it say?

693
36:05.730 --> 36:07.800
The Communist army has occupied Tongzi.

694
36:07.800 --> 36:10.520
The Generalissimo wants us to rush to aid the Guizhou Army,

695
36:10.520 --> 36:12.050
ensure the safety of Zunyi,

696
36:12.320 --> 36:13.320
and not delay.

697
36:13.170 --> 36:14.790
[Wu Qiwei, Commander of the 1st Route Army, 2nd Army Group of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

698
36:13.680 --> 36:15.340
The Communist army is so fast.

699
36:18.970 --> 36:20.800
Unless it's extremely critical,

700
36:20.800 --> 36:22.800
the Generalissimo wouldn't use us.

701
36:29.200 --> 36:30.330
Wusheng (Wu Qiwei),

702
36:30.430 --> 36:32.200
Zhou Hunyuan's troops are still in southern Sichuan.

703
36:32.200 --> 36:33.120
It's too late.

704
36:33.480 --> 36:35.450
I'll have to trouble you to lead the 59th Division

705
36:35.450 --> 36:37.630
and the 93rd Division to set off overnight

706
36:37.630 --> 36:39.420
to reinforce Zunyi.

707
36:48.700 --> 36:49.540
Any problems?

708
36:52.160 --> 36:53.690
Even if I set off overnight,

709
36:54.020 --> 36:56.450
it will take about three days to reach Zunyi.

710
36:56.450 --> 36:57.710
Will we make it in time?

711
37:00.290 --> 37:02.370
Loushanguan is still in the hands of the Guizhou Army.

712
37:02.370 --> 37:04.330
Even if Wang Jialie's troops are a bunch of losers,

713
37:04.330 --> 37:06.250
they can hold out for ten days or so.

714
37:06.250 --> 37:08.030
As long as we don't lose Loushanguan,

715
37:08.030 --> 37:09.160
when you reach Zunyi,

716
37:09.160 --> 37:11.450
you can contain the Communist army in northern Guizhou.

717
37:11.450 --> 37:13.850
You will have done a great service.

718
37:15.640 --> 37:18.680
Commander-in-Chief, I will go assemble the troops now.

719
37:18.680 --> 37:19.770
Be careful on the way.

720
37:19.770 --> 37:21.260
I'll celebrate your success when you return.

721
37:21.260 --> 37:21.890
Yes, sir.

722
37:27.520 --> 37:28.770
Send an urgent telegram to Wang Jialie.

723
37:28.770 --> 37:30.450
Tell him to defend Loushanguan to the death

724
37:30.450 --> 37:31.480
until my reinforcements arrive.

725
37:31.480 --> 37:32.290
Yes, sir.

726
37:42.160 --> 37:50.520
[Zunyi, Guizhou; Wang JiaLie's Headquarters]

727
37:45.250 --> 37:46.370
Loushanguan.

728
37:47.380 --> 37:48.640
Fuchang (Du Zhaohua),

729
37:48.750 --> 37:50.580
I'm leaving Loushanguan to you.

730
37:50.680 --> 37:54.490
[Du Zhaohua, Commander of the 1st Brigade of the 2nd Division of the 25th Army of the KMT Troop]

731
37:56.130 --> 37:59.060
[Wang Jialie, Commander of the Kuomintang’s 25th Army, Chairman of the Guizhou Provincial Government]

732
38:01.520 --> 38:03.640
Just hold Loushanguan for me

733
38:04.450 --> 38:06.250
for three days and three nights,

734
38:06.450 --> 38:09.000
until the Central Army's reinforcements reach Zunyi

735
38:09.000 --> 38:10.820
and the Sichuan Army reaches Tongzi.

736
38:10.820 --> 38:13.700
The Communist army is a dead end.

737
38:13.970 --> 38:15.170
When that time comes,

738
38:15.200 --> 38:16.930
I will personally wire Nanjing

739
38:17.210 --> 38:20.940
to guarantee you to become a major general and division commander.

740
38:23.090 --> 38:23.900
Yes.

741
38:24.420 --> 38:26.980
I will do my best.

742
38:32.080 --> 38:32.960
Fuchang,

743
38:33.370 --> 38:35.930
today I specially approved for your 1st Brigade

744
38:35.930 --> 38:37.160
a hundred boxes

745
38:37.160 --> 38:38.620
of top-grade Yunnan opium

746
38:39.180 --> 38:40.910
and two boxes of premium opium.

747
38:42.540 --> 38:44.140
Those are specially for you.

748
38:45.930 --> 38:47.370
Rest assured, Commander.

749
38:47.370 --> 38:48.120
With me here,

750
38:48.400 --> 38:51.060
the Communist army won't advance a single step.

751
38:53.410 --> 38:54.200
Fuchang,

752
38:54.680 --> 38:55.810
take your soldiers

753
38:56.080 --> 38:59.080
and hold Loushanguan for me.

754
39:00.480 --> 39:01.250
Yes, sir.

755
39:26.840 --> 39:34.450
[Tongzi, Zunyi, Guizhou]

756
39:28.040 --> 39:29.680
According to Comrade Zedong's suggestion,

757
39:29.680 --> 39:32.210
we must take Loushanguan as soon as possible.

758
39:32.560 --> 39:34.360
What is the current deployment?

759
39:34.730 --> 39:35.410
Currently,

760
39:35.850 --> 39:37.890
the 5th and 9th Corps continue to

761
39:38.160 --> 39:40.450
delay along the Wenshui to Tongzi line,

762
39:40.770 --> 39:42.290
blocking the Sichuan Army.

763
39:42.290 --> 39:44.040
We have already wired Peng Dehuai,

764
39:44.040 --> 39:46.040
putting the 1st and 3rd Corps along with the Cadre Regiment

765
39:46.040 --> 39:47.520
under his unified command,

766
39:47.520 --> 39:48.890
ordering him tomorrow

767
39:49.290 --> 39:51.290
to launch an attack on the enemy at Loushanguan.

768
39:51.290 --> 39:53.880
He must take Loushanguan before the 26th.

769
39:57.000 --> 39:57.810
Chairman,

770
39:58.250 --> 40:00.450
Vice Chairman Zhou, Commander-in-Chief,

771
40:00.450 --> 40:02.180
the situation has changed now.

772
40:02.640 --> 40:03.850
Wang Jialie has sent out

773
40:03.850 --> 40:05.930
his main force, the 1st Brigade under Du Zhaohua,

774
40:05.930 --> 40:07.250
rushing to Loushanguan.

775
40:07.250 --> 40:09.450
They are expected to arrive before our army.

776
40:09.450 --> 40:11.970
There are also Guizhou Army troops rushing to reinforce.

777
40:11.970 --> 40:13.520
Any movement from the Central Army?

778
40:13.520 --> 40:16.040
The Second Bureau just deciphered an enemy telegram.

779
40:16.040 --> 40:18.040
Enemy 1st Column Commander Wu Qiwei

780
40:18.250 --> 40:20.480
has led the main 59th and 93rd Divisions

781
40:20.680 --> 40:22.600
to set off overnight for Zunyi.

782
40:22.890 --> 40:24.920
They are expected to arrive in three days.

783
40:24.920 --> 40:27.600
The Sichuan Army's pursuers are expected to arrive in three days.

784
40:27.600 --> 40:28.860
The Central Army's reinforcements

785
40:28.860 --> 40:30.410
are also expected to arrive in three days,

786
40:30.410 --> 40:31.250
which means

787
40:31.660 --> 40:34.220
we only have three days to take Zunyi.

788
40:39.000 --> 40:39.430
Bocheng,

789
40:39.430 --> 40:41.360
what is Peng Dehuai's battle plan?

790
40:41.680 --> 40:44.290
All four regiments of the 3rd Corps will participate.

791
40:44.290 --> 40:46.120
With the 13th Regiment as the vanguard

792
40:46.120 --> 40:47.250
and the 12th Regiment as the rearguard,

793
40:47.250 --> 40:48.290
they will be responsible for the frontal attack.

794
40:48.290 --> 40:50.690
The 10th and 11th Red Regiments will outflank when the opportunity arises.

795
40:50.690 --> 40:52.730
The Cadre Regiment will be the general reserve.

796
40:52.730 --> 40:54.080
After the 1st Red Army Corps builds fortifications,

797
40:54.080 --> 40:55.410
they will follow up from the rear.

798
40:55.410 --> 40:57.540
Once the 3rd Corps takes Loushanguan,

799
40:57.640 --> 40:58.920
the two corps will immediately coordinate

800
40:58.920 --> 41:00.520
to launch an attack on Zunyi.

801
41:03.840 --> 41:06.550
Peng is putting all the burden

802
41:06.750 --> 41:08.710
on the shoulders of the 3rd Corps.

803
41:09.030 --> 41:09.760
Yes.

804
41:10.160 --> 41:12.120
The terrain at Loushanguan is too unique.

805
41:12.120 --> 41:14.100
Our army cannot deploy in large formations.

806
41:14.100 --> 41:15.830
We can only use small units

807
41:15.970 --> 41:16.970
to attack upwards

808
41:17.420 --> 41:19.080
at the enemy positions above.

809
41:20.560 --> 41:22.690
This is destined to be a fierce battle.

810
41:23.890 --> 41:26.560
The timing and terrain are both against us.

811
41:29.690 --> 41:30.650
Comrade Zedong,

812
41:32.000 --> 41:33.160
should we adjust

813
41:33.370 --> 41:35.290
or change the battle plan?

814
41:47.970 --> 41:48.530
No.

815
41:48.850 --> 41:50.310
We must take Loushanguan.

816
41:50.370 --> 41:51.560
If we don't take Loushanguan,

817
41:51.560 --> 41:53.560
we can't occupy Zunyi a second time.

818
41:54.360 --> 41:55.080
During our first occupation of Zunyi,

819
41:55.080 --> 41:55.810
we solved the problem

820
41:55.810 --> 41:57.610
of incorrect military command.

821
41:57.770 --> 41:58.770
With our second occupation of Zunyi,

822
41:58.770 --> 41:59.640
we must secure

823
41:59.890 --> 42:01.950
the strategic military initiative.

824
42:02.330 --> 42:04.390
I need to visit the 13th Red Regiment.

825
42:52.690 --> 42:55.550
[Peng Xuefeng, leader of the Thirteen Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

826
42:53.090 --> 42:54.040
Chairman Mao.

827
42:54.600 --> 42:55.480
Slow down.

828
42:56.200 --> 42:57.150
I am here to see you off.

829
42:57.150 --> 42:57.970
Thank you, Chairman.

830
42:57.970 --> 42:58.820
Thank you, Chairman.
